  "reasoning": "The defendant White1 participated in two separate violent incidents. In the first, he and accomplices assaulted Sun and Wang, using a knife and causing serious injuries (重伤二级). This constitutes intentional injury (故意伤害). In the second incident, White1 and others forcibly seized Dong, bound him with tape, detained him at a remote location, and inflicted a light injury. This is illegal detention (非法拘禁) and also intentional injury, but the primary distinct crime beyond the injury is illegal detention. Therefore the applicable crimes are intentional injury and illegal detention.",
